(6455858, 959235, 43774, '<td valign="top">Oh Jennifer this is adorable! I want to hug her, why is she crying??? Just a beautiful photo.<br/> <br/>BUT (sorry), it''s got a pink tinge to it. I''ve noticed a few of your photos have a pink tinge to them. Are you shooting in a room with red walls? I sometimes get a pink tinge to my photo because I shoot in the basement and the walls are bare &amp; you can see the pink fibreglass insulation and that causes the pink tint. You can get rid of it with custom white balance.</td>', 'Oh Jennifer this is adorable! I want to hug her, why is she crying??? Just a beautiful photo. BUT (sorry), it''s got a pink tinge to it. I''ve noticed a few of your photos have a pink tinge to them. Are you shooting in a room with red walls? I sometimes get a pink tinge to my photo because I shoot in the basement and the walls are bare & you can see the pink fibreglass insulation and that causes the pink tint. You can get rid of it with custom white balance.', '2011-06-29 13:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
