(6456646, 958071, 35086, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast in her eyes, I''m not too fond of grayish background for high key shots, though.  Still very nice.</td>', 'I really like the contrast in her eyes, I''m not too fond of grayish background for high key shots, though.  Still very nice.', '2011-06-30 12:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456647, 958230, 35086, '<td valign="top">Lacks contrasts, photo just seems to be washed out during post process or as if the exposure was way off.  Too much for me perhaps.</td>', 'Lacks contrasts, photo just seems to be washed out during post process or as if the exposure was way off.  Too much for me perhaps.', '2011-06-30 12:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456648, 958993, 35086, '<td valign="top">Simple, beautiful and original.  I shoot a lot of food myself and this is how I like to shoot my dishes, more emphasis on the food and high key helps to add focus on that.  This is stunning, love the direction of the light and the contrast is perfect for this kind of shot.</td>', 'Simple, beautiful and original.  I shoot a lot of food myself and this is how I like to shoot my dishes, more emphasis on the food and high key helps to add focus on that.  This is stunning, love the direction of the light and the contrast is perfect for this kind of shot.', '2011-06-30 12:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456649, 959295, 35086, '<td valign="top">I really like the mood in this one.  Almost longing to feel that way.</td>', 'I really like the mood in this one.  Almost longing to feel that way.', '2011-06-30 12:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456651, 959218, 35086, '<td valign="top">So crisp, focus seems dead on right here.   Lovely shot.</td>', 'So crisp, focus seems dead on right here.   Lovely shot.', '2011-06-30 12:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456654, 958831, 35086, '<td valign="top">High key is high here but for some reason I like it a lot.  Must be the blue in her eyes.  Innocence is often captured perfectly in high key shots.  Effective!</td>', 'High key is high here but for some reason I like it a lot.  Must be the blue in her eyes.  Innocence is often captured perfectly in high key shots.  Effective!', '2011-06-30 12:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456657, 959057, 35086, '<td valign="top">Seems so fragile but perhaps a little too light. I do like the direction, composition and hints of color.</td>', 'Seems so fragile but perhaps a little too light. I do like the direction, composition and hints of color.', '2011-06-30 12:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456658, 959112, 35086, '<td valign="top">This is so refreshing!  Daisies are instant smiles.  Unfortunately the petals do get lost in the background, perhaps some back lighting might have helped with that?  I never shot anything so white on white, can''t be too easy.  Still very nice.</td>', 'This is so refreshing!  Daisies are instant smiles.  Unfortunately the petals do get lost in the background, perhaps some back lighting might have helped with that?  I never shot anything so white on white, can''t be too easy.  Still very nice.', '2011-06-30 12:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456660, 958863, 35086, '<td valign="top">This one seems heavy on the post process.  Also, centered horizons are hard to pull off, maybe that''s what you meant by moving in stereo?  It''s definitely a beautiful sight but it lacks contrast (where needed) and has that HDR-ish look to it.  I guess shooting high key with landscape doesn''t appeal to me all that much.</td>', 'This one seems heavy on the post process.  Also, centered horizons are hard to pull off, maybe that''s what you meant by moving in stereo?  It''s definitely a beautiful sight but it lacks contrast (where needed) and has that HDR-ish look to it.  I guess shooting high key with landscape doesn''t appeal to me all that much.', '2011-06-30 12:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456662, 959298, 35086, '<td valign="top">I like where the emphasis is in this one, on the green and how green it is!  You captured the subtleties ideally, this is very nice.</td>', 'I like where the emphasis is in this one, on the green and how green it is!  You captured the subtleties ideally, this is very nice.', '2011-06-30 12:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456663, 959225, 35086, '<td valign="top">This one doesn''t seem high key but rather washed out.  Definitely needs a bit more contrast, in my opinion.  I do love the bird and the wingspan, that''s very nice indeed.</td>', 'This one doesn''t seem high key but rather washed out.  Definitely needs a bit more contrast, in my opinion.  I do love the bird and the wingspan, that''s very nice indeed.', '2011-06-30 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456665, 959055, 35086, '<td valign="top">The reflection is such a cool element and I like how the horse is just standing there in the middle of the frame, making him the obvious subject.  Good balance of light vs. dark in this high key shot.  This is very nice.</td>', 'The reflection is such a cool element and I like how the horse is just standing there in the middle of the frame, making him the obvious subject.  Good balance of light vs. dark in this high key shot.  This is very nice.', '2011-06-30 12:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6456666, 958359, 35086, '<td valign="top">This is fascinating, they''re right in sync, good timing and awesome capture.  Makes me wonder if you waited for their shifts to change?  There''s also a lot of intrigue, I like how ''foreign'' it feels, it''s like a foreign language captured in a picture.</td>', 'This is fascinating, they''re right in sync, good timing and awesome capture.  Makes me wonder if you waited for their shifts to change?  There''s also a lot of intrigue, I like how ''foreign'' it feels, it''s like a foreign language captured in a picture.', '2011-06-30 13:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
