(6458643, 958230, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing this as high key at all. My understanding of high key is using lighting to reduce or eliminate shadows while still often having a high amount of contrast. Simply moving the brightness slider up doesn''t make a high key photo. I hope this helps.</td>', 'I''m not seeing this as high key at all. My understanding of high key is using lighting to reduce or eliminate shadows while still often having a high amount of contrast. Simply moving the brightness slider up doesn''t make a high key photo. I hope this helps.', '2011-07-02 08:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
