(6459120, 959101, 125275, '<td valign="top">As a trumpet player myself, I love this image. The silvery/white tones work great with the shadows and blacks. It seems like mostly a white image so you''ve got the high key down too. I hope this image does well.</td>', 'As a trumpet player myself, I love this image. The silvery/white tones work great with the shadows and blacks. It seems like mostly a white image so you''ve got the high key down too. I hope this image does well.', '2011-07-02 19:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
