(6459711, 959121, 18778, '<td valign="top">I like the basic stuff here: The lines of glass in contrast with the roundness of the beads; the choice to leave the beads out of focus; having your subject right justified etc.  Nice, clean, high key shot.</td>', 'I like the basic stuff here: The lines of glass in contrast with the roundness of the beads; the choice to leave the beads out of focus; having your subject right justified etc.  Nice, clean, high key shot.', '2011-07-03 12:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459715, 958549, 18778, '<td valign="top">I have challenges with this image- It feels like such a random section of the ring that is in focus.  I''ve never shot jewelry- so take this comment for what that''s worth- but with diamonds I want to see *sparkle* or *illumination* or some kind of ''this is a precious stone'' idea when I see the image of fine jewelry.  This image just falls flat for me.</td>', 'I have challenges with this image- It feels like such a random section of the ring that is in focus.  I''ve never shot jewelry- so take this comment for what that''s worth- but with diamonds I want to see *sparkle* or *illumination* or some kind of ''this is a precious stone'' idea when I see the image of fine jewelry.  This image just falls flat for me.', '2011-07-03 12:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459717, 958413, 18778, '<td valign="top">I always find myself drawn to the natural symmetry of nature &amp; this piece captures that feeling beautifully for me.  However, as with most of the  flower images in this challenge- It doesn''t feel especially creative.  I also like your choice of crop here.</td>', 'I always find myself drawn to the natural symmetry of nature & this piece captures that feeling beautifully for me.  However, as with most of the  flower images in this challenge- It doesn''t feel especially creative.  I also like your choice of crop here.', '2011-07-03 12:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6459724, 959283, 18778, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this image- I have mixed emotions here!<br/>+ It''s interesting.  It''s creative.  It has a haunting feel for me &amp; a unique angle and crop choice that works for me.<br/>- I know it''s a fine line with HK- but it just feels blown out to me.<br/> <br/>But to the important things- you helped me realize how badly I needed to clean my monitor. :D</td>', 'I keep coming back to this image- I have mixed emotions here!+ It''s interesting.  It''s creative.  It has a haunting feel for me & a unique angle and crop choice that works for me.- I know it''s a fine line with HK- but it just feels blown out to me. But to the important things- you helped me realize how badly I needed to clean my monitor. :D', '2011-07-03 12:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
