(6459815, 959217, 96751, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this!!!!  Is this fennel?  Little guys almost gets lost in the detail...  I would LOVE to see this in b/w too.  It looks like fireworks!</td>', 'I LOVE this!!!!  Is this fennel?  Little guys almost gets lost in the detail...  I would LOVE to see this in b/w too.  It looks like fireworks!', '2011-07-03 13:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
