(6460318, 959295, 121949, '<td valign="top">Just came to bump this up, I just love the soft shades of green in this. so simple but so effective. My only tiny critique is the close crop on the left side. I wish there was just a sliver more empty space between the post and the edge of the photo. Even so a 9 from me.</td>', 'Just came to bump this up, I just love the soft shades of green in this. so simple but so effective. My only tiny critique is the close crop on the left side. I wish there was just a sliver more empty space between the post and the edge of the photo. Even so a 9 from me.', '2011-07-04 00:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6460320, 959121, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the layout overall.  Not sure whether I like the items in front being OOF or not.  Biggest distraction for me is the "dirty" area around the stem.  Looks like that area was avoided in post-processing?</td>', 'I like the layout overall.  Not sure whether I like the items in front being OOF or not.  Biggest distraction for me is the "dirty" area around the stem.  Looks like that area was avoided in post-processing?', '2011-07-04 00:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6460323, 959245, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this.  I''d like it even more if 1) I couldn''t see the seam at the back, and 2) the yellow cast was not there (go B&amp;W - at this point just desat to lose the color).  Good luck.</td>', 'I like this.  I''d like it even more if 1) I couldn''t see the seam at the back, and 2) the yellow cast was not there (go B&W - at this point just desat to lose the color).  Good luck.', '2011-07-04 00:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6460325, 958194, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute, but doesn''t really seem "high key" enough for me.  Sorry.  Good luck though.</td>', 'Cute, but doesn''t really seem "high key" enough for me.  Sorry.  Good luck though.', '2011-07-04 00:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6460326, 959215, 30049, '<td valign="top">Feels hazy and lacking contrast, almost like some filtering was applied in post.  ???</td>', 'Feels hazy and lacking contrast, almost like some filtering was applied in post.  ???', '2011-07-04 00:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
