(6461017, 959016, 58634, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, this to me seems more like blown out than high key.. sorry. Aside from that, composition is good.</td>', 'Unfortunately, this to me seems more like blown out than high key.. sorry. Aside from that, composition is good.', '2011-07-04 14:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6461018, 958065, 58634, '<td valign="top">Very abstract and different. I like.</td>', 'Very abstract and different. I like.', '2011-07-04 14:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6461020, 959328, 58634, '<td valign="top">The image is good, but it doesn''t say high key to me. <br/>I like your composition and the fact that the poles are included. It sort of gives the image a sense of framing.</td>', 'The image is good, but it doesn''t say high key to me. I like your composition and the fact that the poles are included. It sort of gives the image a sense of framing.', '2011-07-04 14:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6461024, 959166, 58634, '<td valign="top">Without a title, this image would not strike a lot of attention to me, but the title definitely makes a difference because it engages me in to what is really going on in the picture. <br/>I like the composition, and also like the fact that the dog''s tail is moving and his general stance, too. <br/>I like how dry the plants look, too. <br/> <br/>I guess you could say I like this picture ;)</td>', 'Without a title, this image would not strike a lot of attention to me, but the title definitely makes a difference because it engages me in to what is really going on in the picture. I like the composition, and also like the fact that the dog''s tail is moving and his general stance, too. I like how dry the plants look, too.  I guess you could say I like this picture ;)', '2011-07-04 14:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6461025, 959225, 58634, '<td valign="top">This baby looks menacing!</td>', 'This baby looks menacing!', '2011-07-04 14:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
