(6461156, 958769, 71550, '<td valign="top">There have been some flowers in this challenge, this one is better than most others. My only complaint would be that the step on the right side is a bit blurry. But I still really like how you managed to get that high key feel with the white background and still keep the detail in the flower, even if it could be a big brighter. 7</td>', 'There have been some flowers in this challenge, this one is better than most others. My only complaint would be that the step on the right side is a bit blurry. But I still really like how you managed to get that high key feel with the white background and still keep the detail in the flower, even if it could be a big brighter. 7', '2011-07-04 17:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6461157, 958575, 71550, '<td valign="top">Wow, I really like this building. On my monitor, it doesn''t seem high key enough to me though, which is a shame because it will probably effect the score. I still really like the photo, 7</td>', 'Wow, I really like this building. On my monitor, it doesn''t seem high key enough to me though, which is a shame because it will probably effect the score. I still really like the photo, 7', '2011-07-04 17:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
