(6461163, 959235, 71550, '<td valign="top">A really clean, fantastic portrait. An interesting take on a portrait to have the girl crying, but I think it works very well giving the photo a fragile feeling. 9</td>', 'A really clean, fantastic portrait. An interesting take on a portrait to have the girl crying, but I think it works very well giving the photo a fragile feeling. 9', '2011-07-04 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
