(6461183, 959055, 71550, '<td valign="top">Wow, excellent landscape here. The only thing I don''t like is that my eye is immediately drawn to the lower sky, which is the main point of high key. I think that had it been cropped out possibly and some on the sides, the brightness could have been raised to create a brighter shot overall without blowing out the top portion. Still, one of the best in the challenge even if it is a little darker than a high key should be. 8</td>', 'Wow, excellent landscape here. The only thing I don''t like is that my eye is immediately drawn to the lower sky, which is the main point of high key. I think that had it been cropped out possibly and some on the sides, the brightness could have been raised to create a brighter shot overall without blowing out the top portion. Still, one of the best in the challenge even if it is a little darker than a high key should be. 8', '2011-07-04 18:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
