(6462491, 958913, 132967, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Revecca:</b></div><hr/><i> Composition is fantastic, as well as point of view. I like the baby''s position, almost as if he/she is pointing to you. I just wish the focus was a bit sharper, and also, that the light you used wouldn''t have created a green tint throughout the image. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Revecca:  I checked several monitors and didn''t see the green tint.  Sorry you were disappointed in my picture.</td>', 'Originally posted by Revecca: Composition is fantastic, as well as point of view. I like the baby''s position, almost as if he/she is pointing to you. I just wish the focus was a bit sharper, and also, that the light you used wouldn''t have created a green tint throughout the image.   Revecca:  I checked several monitors and didn''t see the green tint.  Sorry you were disappointed in my picture.', '2011-07-06 01:37:10.000000', NULL, 0),
