(6468059, 958571, 114259, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by blindjustice:</b></div><hr/><i> Georgia O''Keefe would be proud. Nice work. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You are the third or fourth person to mention that. I had to go look up her work to see what you meant.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the feedback.</td>', 'Originally posted by blindjustice: Georgia O''Keefe would be proud. Nice work.   You are the third or fourth person to mention that. I had to go look up her work to see what you meant. Thanks for the feedback.', '2011-07-11 20:51:14.000000', NULL, 0),
