(6477517, 959184, 28427, '<td valign="top">Coming back to this entry: now that this is appears to be a self (this was unknown during the voting round) I can only say one thing: "Chapeau".  <br/>Focusing through what looks to be wires? and having your face so in focus is not easy when pushing the button yourself on top op it.<br/>B.T.W. - you look very much like Hale Berry this way :)</td>', 'Coming back to this entry: now that this is appears to be a self (this was unknown during the voting round) I can only say one thing: "Chapeau".  Focusing through what looks to be wires? and having your face so in focus is not easy when pushing the button yourself on top op it.B.T.W. - you look very much like Hale Berry this way :)', '2011-07-21 07:08:14.000000', NULL, 0),
