(6498810, 959184, 47316, '<td valign="top">This is actually cellophane. I can''t seem to figure out how to change the info post-challenge so I''ll just let you all know here. Thanks for the kind comments! It was a rather difficult shot to get with no one behind the camera. I quite often have funky crops that people nit pick about but I like them. Though honestly no, it wasn''t intentional here, it''s a nice happenstance I think.</td>', 'This is actually cellophane. I can''t seem to figure out how to change the info post-challenge so I''ll just let you all know here. Thanks for the kind comments! It was a rather difficult shot to get with no one behind the camera. I quite often have funky crops that people nit pick about but I like them. Though honestly no, it wasn''t intentional here, it''s a nice happenstance I think.', '2011-08-09 03:50:23.000000', NULL, 0),
